data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Deciphering the Pattern**\n\nI'm currently breaking down the user's request. It's a number sequence problem, and understanding the core pattern is key. The prompt is also seeking explicit reasoning, so, I need to outline each step in solving the pattern in numbers.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0,"safetyRatings": [{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HATE_SPEECH","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HARASSMENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_DANGEROUS_CONTENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"}]}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 34,"totalTokenCount": 103,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 34}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 69,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-pro","responseId": "PhOIatLmLNia28oP_fKq2AU"}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Unveiling the Logic**\n\nI've moved on to analyzing the differences between consecutive terms. The first-level differences, 4, 6, 8, and 10, clearly form an arithmetic progression. I can predict the next difference will be 12. Adding this to the last number in the original sequence, 30, leads me to the answer, 42. I'm preparing to explicitly state this process.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0,"safetyRatings": [{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HATE_SPEECH","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HARASSMENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_DANGEROUS_CONTENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"}]}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 34,"totalTokenCount": 450,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 34}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 416,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-pro","responseId": "PhOIatLmLNia28oP_fKq2AU"}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Formulating the Explanation**\n\nI'm now drafting the step-by-step reasoning. I plan to present the solution, detailing the difference method first. Following that, I intend to provide a formulaic representation to offer a more insightful view of the sequence's construction, ensuring clarity and demonstrating a solid grasp of the underlying mathematical principles. I'm focusing on ensuring it's both straightforward and thorough.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0,"safetyRatings": [{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HATE_SPEECH","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HARASSMENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_DANGEROUS_CONTENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"}]}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 34,"totalTokenCount": 771,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 34}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 737,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-pro","responseId": "PhOIatLmLNia28oP_fKq2AU"}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Synthesizing the Reasoning**\n\nI've just refined the explanation using two perspectives. I'll begin by outlining the difference method, providing a clear, step-by-step calculation, and then I'll follow with a formula, expressing the sequence as n \\* (n+1) for n starting at 1. The goal is to provide multiple avenues for user comprehension. I'm focusing on ensuring both clarity and completeness in the final output.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0,"safetyRatings": [{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HATE_SPEECH","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HARASSMENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_DANGEROUS_CONTENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"}]}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 34,"totalTokenCount": 976,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 34}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 942,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-pro","responseId": "PhOIatLmLNia28oP_fKq2AU"}

